<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-20T21:23:34.269Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:23:34 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi security forces and the Iran-backed militia Kataib Hezbollah have reached a compromise that creates a joint security command in the Jurf al-Nasr and Jurf al-Sakhar areas, while Prime Minister Ali al-Zaidi has ordered a separate command for the same region. A security convoy flying Iraqi flags was deployed into a militia stronghold, and Iraqi forces moved into Jurf al-Sakhar after the deal with the Iran-backed group. Iraqi forces also struck a compromise with a powerful pro-Iran militia and deployed in a Hezbollah stronghold under the agreement. The UCDP recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/iraq-s-risky-standoff-the-state-vs-iran-allied-militias/a-79995757?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTFBKVTFzNE03c0FldEFfdjd1My1Yb2ZNZlJQRmFheGczdFh3a0tsTk96RzJETWE4WTVQM2VJY2U4emhJa2RURVE1QTBydlc0YndvZV81MmhnU3JGdXdEMTRHQkdMdFFxNE0?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/20/world/middleeast/iraq-militia-iran-kataib-hezbollah.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxNd2NmVkpkOFlUNVlxZF8xVXhKTUpESVZ0Q0pnVllMeUxmbFBGTjl1UjdNSVg0ajhKQ01hVmYzZW1mcWxFa2VCQ0poLUdvSi1GWWtYZFJYTEZicWlBYWZmZ2ZsVzdNNE1YT09yNjVyamhNMGZsbFZwNVBxVjRWeGM1Sno4endBRnVud3JvQVNIVDVyS0ZaWGMwZkp6TXpmTkZTdlNsSEQyOA?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxNMGw4NHg3LTluajJnNG03Y1FEa0lyZklBeExybjJXdUFfNXAwdGszbUJoM25KVW5qQnhTcUxmSmh4dFEyZW1tbEtpd3JUVDhZcW8zVWwxTlUzTUFxRlAtTUZVeUlyaS0tTXloOHVaNS16b0ZQSnp2ZjFJYTl0UVRqdkRwTEp0bzhpOVM3UEVRUVBHTkozbGg1OF